<title>USA: Hughes Supply ends Air Systems talks.</title>
<headline>Hughes Supply ends Air Systems talks.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Supply Inc said on Friday it terminated its discussions with Air Systems Distributors Inc, due to certain contingences not being satisfied.</p>
<p>Hughes Supply in its news release provided no further details about the talks or why they were discontinued.</p>
<p>Hughes distributes industrial and construction materials.</p>
